age  with hanging there and no recovery might  be tough but based on what I've seen  [Music]  Evans is totally right and we'd like to  add our voice to the chorus praising  Bridger for his marvelous act of heroism  we wish him a speedy recovery oh we have  a feeling the little guy won't be down  for long check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite superhero  stories are coming soon subscribe to our  YouTube channel and hit the belt so you  don't miss a single one  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

